{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/program' data-target='computer\/program' data-title='Program'>\r\n\t\t\tProgram\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/program\/openssl' data-target='computer\/program\/openssl' data-title='OpenSSL'>\r\n\t\t\tOpenSSL\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"SSL certificate - external: 1. Generate Private key, 2. Create the CSR file, 1. Provide details on prompt, The output content of CSR file can be verified using, and 5. Create certificate file.","label":"SSL certificate - external","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/program\/openssl\/notes","label":"Notes","url":"\/computer\/program\/openssl\/notes"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/program\/openssl\/ssl_certificate_internal","label":"SSL certificate - internal","url":"\/computer\/program\/openssl\/ssl_certificate_internal"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<h2>1. Generate Private key<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>openssl genrsa -out san_domain.com.key 2048<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\t?not protected - no passphrase?\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>2. Create the CSR file<\/h2>\n\t<h2>1. Provide details on prompt<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>1. openssl req -new -newkey rsa:2048 -nodes -keyout server.key -out server.csr<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>2. Provide details file &lt;openssl.cnf&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>1. openssl req -new -out san_domain.com.csr -key san_domain.com.key -config openssl.cnf<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tIf prompt=yes.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tValue (from key=value) is taken as title for that key at the prompt.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tDefaultValue is used.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>openssl req -new -newkey rsa:2048 -nodes -out &lt;Sub-domain&gt;_&lt;Domain&gt;.&lt;TLD&gt;.csr -keyout &lt;Sub-domain&gt;_&lt;Domain&gt;.&lt;TLD&gt;.key -subj \"\/C=&lt;Country_Code&gt;\/ST=&lt;State&gt;\/L=&lt;City&gt;\/O=&lt;Organization&gt;\/CN=&lt;Sub-domain&gt;_&lt;Domain&gt;_&lt;TLD&gt;\"<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>The output content of CSR file can be verified using<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>openssl req -text -noout -in &lt;file.csr&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<ol class=\"list-number content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>Send CSR &gt; Authenticate &gt; Obtain cert chain files.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<ol class=\"list-number content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>Generate bundle file by concatenating the CA files.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<h2>5. Create certificate file<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>openssl pkcs12 -export -in Sub.Domain.TLD.crt -inkey Sub.Domain.TLD.key -out Sub.Domain.TLD.p12 -name tomcat -CAfile Sub.Domain.TLD.ca-bundle -caname root -chain<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSAN - Subject Alternative Names.\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/program\/openssl\/ssl_certificate_external\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/program\/openssl\/ssl_certificate_external\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/program\/openssl\/notes' data-target='computer\/program\/openssl\/notes' data-title='Notes' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible item_block_image_contain' src='\/computer\/program\/openssl\/notes.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>Notes<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/program\/openssl\/ssl_certificate_internal' data-target='computer\/program\/openssl\/ssl_certificate_internal' data-title='SSL certificate - internal' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - next page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>SSL certificate - internal<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25BA;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/program\/openssl' data-target='computer\/program\/openssl' data-title='OpenSSL'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/computer\/program\/openssl.svg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>OpenSSL<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25B2;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t<\/a> <\/div>\r\n"}